 many tutorials already exist on this topic. This page will however go over the creation of MRAO textures and the creation of the material file.",{"start":54,"end":57},{"line":55,"column":10,"offset":56},6,75,{"line":55,"column":58,"offset":59},619,693,{"start":61,"end":62},{"line":55,"column":10,"offset":56},{"line":55,"column":58,"offset":59},{"type":17,"depth":33,"children":64,"position":74},[65],{"type":20,"value":66,"position":67},"Obtaining PBR textures",{"start":68,"end":71},{"line":69,"column":14,"offset":70},7,697,{"line":69,"column":72,"offset":73},26,719,{"start":75,"end":77},{"line":69,"column":10,"offset":76},694,{"line":69,"column":72,"offset":73},{"type":49,"children":79,"position":115},[80,89,108],{"type":20,"value":81,"position":82},"As stated before, PBR textures need to be created in specialized programs. If you do not possess a license to paid programs like Adobe or a computer powerful enough to run programs like Blender, some free and relatively easy-to-run programs exist like ",{"start":83,"end":86},{"line":84,"column":10,"offset":85},8,720,{"line":84,"column":87,"offset":88},253,972,{"type":90,"title":91,"url":92,"children":93,"position":103},"link",null,"https://boundingboxsoftware.com/materialize/",[94],{"type":20,"value":95,"position":96},"Materialize",{"start":97,"end":100},{"line":84,"column":98,"offset":99},254,973,{"line":84,"column":101,"offset":102},265,984,{"start":104,"end":105},{"line":84,"column":87,"offset":88},{"line":84,"column":106,"offset":107},312,1031,{"type":20,"value":109,"position":110},". Here is a list of textures needed to create a fully functional PBR material:",{"start":111,"end":112},{"line":84,"column":106,"offset":107},{"line":84,"column":113,"offset":114},390,1109,{"start":116,"end":117},{"line":84,"column":10,"offset":85},{"line":84,"column":113,"offset":114},{"type":119,"ordered":1,"start":91,"spread":120,"children":121,"position":436},"list",true,[122,159,231,314],{"type":123,"spread":1,"checked":91,"children